{"study_accession":"PRJNA738888","secondary_study_accession":"SRP324507","title":"Identification of immune correlates of fatal outcomes in critically ill COVID-19 patients","description":"Single-cell RNA-sequencing reveals a shift from focused IFN alpha-driven signals in COVID-19 ICU patients who survive to broad pro-inflammatory responses in fatal COVID-19 – a feature not observed in severe influenza. We conclude that fatal COVID-19 infection is driven by uncoordinated inflammatory responses that drive a hierarchy of T cell activation, elements of which can serve as prognostic indicators and potential targets for immune intervention. Overall design: scRNA-seq of PBMCs from severe COVID patients using nanowell based method Seq-Well.","pubmed":"34529726","geo_series":"","n_samples":24,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMN19763672","study_accession":"PRJNA738888","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"PBMCs of flu patient 6.7","description":"PBMCs of flu patient 6.7","sex":"male","geo_sample":"GSM5390366","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-06-21","attributes":[["source_name","PBMCs"],["sex","male"],["survival outcome","Yes"],["disease","flu"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14854187","experiment_accession":"SRX11172711","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"cDNA","instrument_model":"NextSeq 500","read_count":159794741,"base_count":11250111903,"first_public":"2021-06-21","experiment_title":"NextSeq 500 sequencing: GSM5390366: PBMCs of flu patient 6.7 Homo sapiens RNA-Seq"}],"labels":[]},{"sample_accession":"SAMN19763673","study_accession":"PRJNA738888","blood_class":"pbmc","class_from":"sample","title":"PBMCs of flu patient 6.12","description":"PBMCs of flu patient 6.12","sex":"female","geo_sample":"GSM5390365","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2021-06-21","attributes":[["source_name","PBMCs"],["sex","female"],["survival outcome","Yes"],["disease","flu"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"SRR14854186","experiment_a